00:04:43,333 --> 00:04:49,333
Rewind and love again.

2
00:09:26,666 --> 00:09:32,666
Press Play is a music, romance, science fiction film directed by Greg Björkman.

3
00:14:10,000 --> 00:14:16,000
Laura and Harrison have the picture-perfect romance built on
the foundation of a shared love of music.

4
00:18:53,333 --> 00:18:59,333
After a deadly accident, Laura gets the chance to save the love of her life when
she discovers that their mixtape can transport her back in time.

5
00:23:36,666 --> 00:23:42,666
Laura, played by Clara Rugaard.

6
00:28:20,000 --> 00:28:26,000
Harrison, played by Lewis Pullman.

7
00:33:03,333 --> 00:33:09,333
Cooper, played by Danny Glover.

8
00:37:46,666 --> 00:37:52,666
Chloe, played by Lyrica Okano.

9
00:42:30,000 --> 00:42:36,000
Mrs. Knott, played by Christina Chang.

10
00:47:13,333 --> 00:47:19,333
Mr. Knott, played by Matt Walsh.

11
00:51:56,666 --> 00:52:02,666
Press Play is a 2022 science fiction romantic drama film written by Greg Björkman and James
Bachelor, and directed by Björkman in his directorial debut, from a story by Josh Boone.

12
00:56:40,000 --> 00:56:46,000
It stars Clara Rugaard, Lewis Pullman, Lyrica Okano,
Christina Chang, Matt Walsh, and Danny Glover.

13
01:01:23,333 --> 01:01:29,333
It was shot on Oahu.

14
01:06:06,666 --> 01:06:12,666
The film was released in the United States on June 24, 2022, by The Avenue.

15
01:10:50,000 --> 01:10:56,000
It received mixed reviews from critics.

16
01:15:33,333 --> 01:15:39,333
The film explores themes of time travel, time, destiny, music.

17
01:20:16,666 --> 01:20:22,666
The tone is emotional and thought_provoking.
